{"item_id": "e4cc3d6c6c7bdbde", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "【视频播客】裁员潮下，互联网人该不该做独立开发？", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wHWo6ZEun", "project_url": null, "author": "熠辉IndieDev", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/39930228", "published_at": "2026-11-13T08:00:00+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-16T10:07:00+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "离开大厂，靠自己的产品能养活自己吗？这期结合我两年半独立开发的真实经历，聊聊 AI 时代互联网人的机会、工程师的优势，以及从找需求、做产品到获客赚钱的思路。也分享我为什么从内容变现转向做产品，以及「给 Agent 做产品」这个值得探索的方向。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 20204, "danmaku": 6, "favorites": 1107}, "tags": ["VibeCoding", "上B站看播客", "视频播客", "AI"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1wHWo6ZEun", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wHWo6ZEun", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "new", "run_id": "20261116T095957"}
{"item_id": "92d5c8b5d06bc86b", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "数字游民必看 | 独立开发者的出海赚钱实战经验分享!", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1d9dKYxEiX", "project_url": null, "author": "OpenBuild开源社区", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/483336099", "published_at": "2025-04-09T23:45:52+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-16T10:07:00+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "主持人: 秋秋 @0xqiuqiuu\n嘉宾: Levi Yuan@leviyuen\n\n本期我们 OpenBuild 有幸采访到资深独立开发者 Levi Yuan，分享他如何从传统职场转型为独立开发者，并成功实现出海接单赚取美金的宝贵经验。\n\n嘉宾介绍: \nLevi 个人分享，35被裁员，自学编程，独立开发🧑‍💻\n\n分享内容\n1.为什么选择独立开发 \n2.通过软件赚美金为什么是一个不错的商业模式 \n3.我是如何从0到1学习编程的 \n4.我从独立开发到成为数字游民的经历分享", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 41066, "danmaku": 7, "favorites": 3081}, "tags": ["互联网", "Web3", "经验分享", "项目", "数字游民", "独立开发者"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1d9dKYxEiX", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1d9dKYxEiX", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261116T095957"}
{"item_id": "d550d66edae3b561", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "AI 时代，独立开发还走得通吗？我卖过小工具，也亲眼看着这层塌了", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MEs569EX6", "project_url": null, "author": "ZTough", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/42484832", "published_at": "2026-11-14T19:06:06+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-16T10:07:00+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "AI 时代，独立开发还走得通吗？我做过一个小工具，卖出去过一点，后来遇到一个完全不会写代码的人，用 AI 做出来的东西比我的还好用。\n\n这期讲清三件事：\n1. 被 AI 抹平的到底是哪一层\n2. 为什么真正拦住人的不是\"能不能做出来\"\n3. 还通着的是哪条路，为什么它更像一场赌博\n\n你也在用 AI 做东西的话，评论区聊聊你的判断。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 4346, "danmaku": 2, "favorites": 28}, "tags": ["AI 做软件", "AI 编程", "软件创业", "小工具", "商业化", "独立开发", "副业"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1MEs569EX6", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MEs569EX6", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "new", "run_id": "20261116T095957"}
